---
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import FormationGraphic from '../components/FormationGraphic.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '../assets/people/marcel-mare.png';

---
<BaseLayout title="About The Spotted Ape — Strategic Decisions & Behavioural Design" description="The independent practice of Marcel Maré. Helping teams find formation: strategic decisions, behavioural design and human judgement.">
<PageIntro scale="long" description="When conditions turn chaotic, speed is not your friend.">
<Fragment slot="heading">Everyone is moving.<br />Are we moving<br />together?</Fragment>
</PageIntro>
<section class="about-field theme-dark section-y" id="section-01">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="split-layout">
<div class="about-statement">
<h2>Movement needs<br />direction.</h2>
<p class="lead" data-sweep>Under pressure, capable teams can pursue conflicting priorities without recognising the disagreement.</p>
</div>
<div class="formation-frame">
<FormationGraphic variant="about" />
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section-y name-story" id="name" aria-labelledby="name-title">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="split-layout">
<h2 class="section-title" id="name-title" data-reveal>Why The<br />Spotted Ape?</h2>
<div>
<div class="prose">
<p>During the Second World War, hundreds of bombers took off from airfields across East Anglia and had to find one another in fog before they could set out together.</p>
<p>Each group was gathered by an assembly ship, an aircraft painted to be seen. The 458th Bomb Group’s was a polka-dotted Liberator its crews called the Spotted Ape. From June 1944 it climbed first, circled a fixed point and fired its flares until the formation held.</p>
<p>Then it turned for home.</p>
<p>That is the idea behind The Spotted Ape: a point of orientation when conditions are confusing, help in finding direction, and people left able to carry on without us.</p>
</div>
<p class="display-copy name-principle">Useful, never indispensable.</p>
<a class="text-link" href="https://spottedape.substack.com/p/the-flying-spotted-ass-ape-and-the">Read the essay <Arrow /></a>
<figure class="name-photo">
<img src="/images/history/spotted-ape-show-off-ship.jpg" width="1600" height="1235" alt="The nose of the Spotted Ape, painted white with dark polka dots, a large eye and a shark’s mouth. A pilot in flying gear walks away across the airfield." loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
<figcaption>The Spotted Ape at its base in England. Wartime press photograph, courtesy of the 458th Bomb Group association.</figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section-y" id="section-05">
<span id="section-02" aria-hidden="true"></span>
<div class="wrap">
<div class="split-layout">
<div class="practitioner-name">
<h2>Marcel<br />Maré.</h2>
<p class="lead">Behavioural designer.<br />Researcher. Strategic consultant.</p>
<Image
  class="practitioner-portrait"
  src={portrait}
  alt="Portrait of Marcel Maré: a close-up of his face, looking straight at the camera, in a dark T-shirt against a dark background."
  widths={[400, 640, 1008]}
  sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 40px), 420px"
  format="webp"
  quality={80}
  loading="lazy"
  decoding="async"
/>
<a class="text-link" href="https://marcelmare.com">Professional biography <Arrow />
</a>
</div>
<div class="practitioner-copy">
<p class="display-copy">What enables people to move from knowing what is possible to actually doing something worthwhile?</p>
<div class="prose">
<p>The Spotted Ape is the independent strategic practice of Marcel Maré, a behavioural designer, researcher and strategic consultant working across design, human behaviour and emerging technology.</p>
<p>His work has ranged from understanding why households adopt new energy technologies to helping organisations navigate strategic choices and technological change.</p>
</div>
<a class="button button--talk" href="/contact/?source=%2Fabout">Let’s talk
</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.about-statement h2 {
  font-size: var(--heading-2);
  line-height: 1;
  max-width: 15ch;
}
.about-statement .lead {
  margin-top: 40px;
}
.formation-frame {
  min-width: 0;
  align-self: center;
}
.name-principle {
  margin-top: 40px;
}
.name-story .text-link {
  margin-top: 24px;
}
.name-photo {
  margin: var(--space-md) 0 0;
}
.name-photo img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  border-radius: var(--radius-card);
}
.name-photo figcaption {
  margin-top: 12px;
  font: var(--font-label);
  color: var(--text-muted);
}
.practitioner-name h2 {
  font-size: var(--display-l);
  line-height: var(--leading-display);
  margin-block: 0 40px;
}
.practitioner-portrait {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 420px;
  height: auto;
  margin-top: 40px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-card);
}
.practitioner-name .text-link {
  margin-top: 32px;
}
.practitioner-copy .display-copy {
  padding-bottom: 40px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}
.practitioner-copy .button {
  margin-top: 40px;
}
@media (max-width: 1023px) {
  .about-statement h2 {
    font-size: var(--compact-xl);
  }
  .practitioner-name h2 {
    font-size: 100px;
  }
}
@media (max-width: 767px) {
  .about-statement h2 {
    font-size: 44px;
  }
  .practitioner-name h2 {
    font-size: 88px;
  }
  .about-field .split-layout {
    gap: 56px;
  }
}
</style>
